    "jobDescription": "<h3 data-start=\"557\" data-end=\"586\" class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"561\" data-end=\"586\">Key\n\nRESPONSIBILITIES:\n</strong></h3> <ul data-start=\"588\" data-end=\"1339\"> <li data-start=\"588\" data-end=\"669\" class=\"\"> <p data-start=\"590\" data-end=\"669\" class=\"\">Act on leads assigned by the Team Leader in a timely and professional manner.</p> </li> <li data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"743\" class=\"\"> <p data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"743\" class=\"\">Visit customer locations to perform thorough inspections of vehicles.</p> </li> <li data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"1009\" class=\"\"> <p data-start=\"746\" data-end=\"815\" class=\"\">Evaluate and diagnose issues across key vehicle systems, including:</p> <ul data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"1009\"> <li data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"857\" class=\"\"> <p data-start=\"820\" data-end=\"857\" class=\"\">Chassis, panels, and body condition</p> </li> <li data-start=\"860\" data-end=\"890\" class=\"\"> <p data-start=\"862\" data-end=\"890\" class=\"\">Paint and exterior quality</p> </li> <li data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"924\" class=\"\"> <p data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"924\" class=\"\">Engine performance and wear</p> </li> <li data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"964\" class=\"\"> <p data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"964\" class=\"\">Clutch, gearbox, and transmission</p> </li> <li data-start=\"967\" data-end=\"1009\" class=\"\"> <p data-start=\"969\" data-end=\"1009\" class=\"\">Brake system and suspension components</p> </li> </ul> </li> <li data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1112\" class=\"\"> <p data-start=\"1012\" data-end=\"1112\" class=\"\">Capture high-quality images of vehicle parts and upload them to the designated mobile application.</p> </li> <li data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1167\" class=\"\"> <p data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1167\" class=\"\">Accurately estimate the cost of necessary repairs.</p> </li> <li data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1261\" class=\"\"> <p data-start=\"1170\" data-end=\"1261\" class=\"\">Submit inspection reports and estimates via the app in the required format and timelines.</p> </li> <li data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1339\" class=\"\"> <p data-start=\"1264\" data-end=\"1339\" class=\"\">Ensure transparency and professionalism while interacting with customers.</p></li></ul> <h3 data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1367\" class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1350\" data-end=\"1367\">Requirements:</strong></h3> <ul data-start=\"1369\" data-end=\"1791\"> <li data-start=\"1369\" data-end=\"1434\" class=\"\"> <p data-start=\"1371\" data-end=\"1434\" class=\"\">Strong technical knowledge of vehicle components and systems.</p> </li> <li data-start=\"1435\" data-end=\"1510\" class=\"\"> <p data-start=\"1437\" data-end=\"1510\" class=\"\">Ability to identify wear, damage, or potential issues in used vehicles.</p> </li> <li data-start=\"1511\" data-end=\"1589\" class=\"\"> <p data-start=\"1513\" data-end=\"1589\" class=\"\">Comfortable using mobile apps for uploading images and submitting reports.</p> </li> <li data-start=\"1590\" data-end=\"1641\" class=\"\"> <p data-start=\"1592\" data-end=\"1641\" class=\"\">Basic English reading and comprehension skills.</p> </li> <li data-start=\"1642\" data-end=\"1748\" class=\"\"> <p data-start=\"1644\" data-end=\"1748\" class=\"\">Prior experience in vehicle inspection, evaluation, or a related automotive service role is preferred.</p> </li> <li data-start=\"1749\" data-end=\"1791\" class=\"\"> <p data-start=\"1751\" data-end=\"1791\" class=\"\">Two-wheeler driving license is a plus.</p> </li> </ul> <hr data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"1796\" class=\"\">",
